                <note rend="inline" type="source">124.1718/139: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Thurston</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-08-01T16:00:00-05:45"><hi rendition="#italic">August 1,
                                1925—4 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 11:15
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>126. The Legation guard left Managua this morning and arrived at Corinto this
                    afternoon.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Thurston</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
